  "title": "Vertiv Announces the Completion of Debt Refinancing Activities",
  "summary": "The closing of this refinancing activity is a significant milestone for Vertiv. This refinancing, in conjunction with the significant paydown of debt with proceeds from the SPAC transaction, will reduce our annual run-rate cash interest by almost $160 million. Our refinanced capital structure provides tremendous flexibility to support our strategic initiatives going forward,” said David J. Fallon, Chief Financial Officer for Vertiv.",
